WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.327
Your draft, its PDF, and an assistant ready to help.

2
00:00:03.327 --> 00:00:08.545
Describe the change you want.

3
00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:17.099
The agent edits and compiles. Waiting time is shortened.

4
00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:22.807
Read the exact changes before approving.

5
00:00:22.807 --> 00:00:27.936
Check the result in the compiled PDF.

6
00:00:27.936 --> 00:00:30.684
Approve the edit when you are happy with it.

7
00:00:30.684 --> 00:00:36.923
Saved locally. Connected projects can also sync to Overleaf.
